/>\n\n### Data processing pipeline\nFrom importing files, processing phase, \
material parameters to giving the results back", "Display" -> "markdown", 
    "Hash" -> "295ffd25-1eba-41b4-b7be-4e83fbc09b6d", "Invisible" -> False, 
